WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.287
A strong reshaping project includes validation at every stage.

00:00:04.287 --> 00:00:07.517
State the grain before and after the reshape.

00:00:07.517 --> 00:00:10.412
Compare totals for additive measures.

00:00:10.412 --> 00:00:15.067
Check whether null values were preserved or intentionally changed.

00:00:15.067 --> 00:00:18.137
Confirm that expected categories are present.

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:23.417
Also check joins. Did the row count increase more than expected?

00:00:23.417 --> 00:00:27.597
Did one to many relationships create duplicated facts?

00:00:27.597 --> 00:00:31.764
Validation gives you evidence that the result is actually correct.
